        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "TrendForce: DRAM Supply Shortage to Persist Through 2027… NVIDIA Considering Downgrading Rubin Ultra's HBM Configuration  - According to TrendForce's latest memory industry research, the DRAM supply shortage is expected to continue through 2027, and with uncertainties remaining",
