          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "AMD MI355X vLLM HAS BEATEN B200 vLLM ON KIMI K2.5 (THE SAME MODEL ARCH AS XAI CURSOR COMPOSER 2.5)   This uses upstream AMD kernels from the  @GPU_MODE  community. We explain below  1/6",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2083598748018454726",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-02T01:00:27.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 789
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Counterpoint Research published a worthwhile piece on the reported U.S. restrictions on imports of Chinese optical modules.  \"In an AI supercluster, a missing batch of optical transceivers renders billion-dollar GPU allocations idle. Constraining transceiver imports risks",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084839619255013478",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-05T11:11:14.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 440
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "If AMD’s share price rises to the $600-700 range – the capital cost for the GPUs only will effectively be zero for both! If AMD continues to make strides improving their software stack and winning large customer orders and sees their share price increase above $1,000 – then this",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2084278535640830193",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T22:01:41.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 152
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "This is not a small-deployment thing, top dogs are doing it. Microsoft Fairwater runs the GPU hall fully unbacked, gensets only on the network core. Anthropic's datacenter design also strips the genset. Meta's AI datacenters (the two that look like a Rectangle and Tent) show zero",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2084811557964231066",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-05T09:19:44.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 111
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "AMD 因記憶體短缺，計畫對板卡合作夥伴（如 PowerColor、Sapphire、XFX）的 GPU 核心與顯存捆綁價格上漲約 10%。  目前 Radeon RX 9000 系列定價明顯低於同級 GeForce：RX 9070 GRE 約 549 美元、RX 9070 約 640 美元、RX 9070 XT 約 689 美元，而 RTX 5070 約 630 美元、RTX 5070 Ti 約 950",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2083765499398353217",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-02T12:03:04.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 98
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "But why run a GPU cluster with zero backup power?    training doesn't care, constant checkpointing tolerates downtime    build speed and cost, realizing capex savings and cutting lead times, permits, commissioning, and multi-vendor contracts. Today, bringing compute online f",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2084811556974473416",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-05T09:19:43.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 92
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "英偉達正權衡激進方案，考慮大幅削減新一代旗艦 Rubin Ultra GPU 的高帶寬記憶體（HBM）容量。原型機已出現記憶體配置明顯低於預期的版本，未來同一代產品可能推出多種不同記憶體規格。",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2085534609694196111",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-07T09:12:52.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 70
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "AMD launched a $1.1 mil kernel hackathon in collaboration with  @GPU_MODE , and the Readonflow Team’s kernels improved end-to-end upstream MI355X performance by over 4x. 2/6",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2083598749574554081",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-02T01:00:27.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 58
        }
