          "text": "Kimi Developer Moonshot AI Plans to File for Hong Kong IPO This Month, Targeting $3 Billion Raise  • Moonshot AI is expected to submit its Hong Kong IPO application as early as this month, seeking to raise approximately $3 billion.  • The company recently closed a Series F",
